{
  "comment": "Conformance vectors for the NetworkPolicy in src/policy.mjs. The test suite runs every vector; a change that alters any decision fails with the vector's name. Policy options use snake_case (a historical artifact of the fixture format); the test maps them to camelCase. Private networks and loopback are OPEN by default, so vectors that exercise the strict blocking path set allow_private_network/allow_loopback to false explicitly. The cloud-metadata floor is never disabled by those flags. reason_contains, when present, must be a substring of the returned reason.",
